The WIZnet W5100 datasheet (version 1.2.4) and the Uthernet II User's and
Programmer's Manual (a2RetroSystems, 17 Nov 18), including its schematic,
are the references for the model; see HARDWARE-REFERENCE.md.

AppleWin's Uthernet II implementation (source/Uthernet2.cpp, GPL) was
read as a cross-check of behavior on points the datasheet doesn't settle,
each listed in HARDWARE-REFERENCE.md. No code was taken from it.
